# Recipe of the Z9X HB HDMI input app (org.lumen.tvinput), read by tools/devices/assemble_app.py. The HB app is the
# Z9X app plus the HB layer (apps/HbTvInput: since Z9X 1.0.8 only res/values/bools.xml, a fork with a row in
# devices/goat_elegant/forks.tsv: the one-time BACK hint on). The Z9X folder is only read; the Z9X image keeps
# its pinned Z9xTvInput.apk.
app       HbTvInput
base      apps/Z9xTvInput
top       apps/HbTvInput
# never part of an app tree: build output, APKs, notes, the build version (read by tools/devices/build_apps.sh)
skip      build/ *.apk CHANGES*.md README*.md SYNCED.txt .DS_Store BUILD_VERSION
